  "description": "A cutting-edge, non-throwing C# validation library. Validates emails, region-aware phone numbers and postal codes, dates, URLs, credit card numbers, passwords, IP addresses, numeric ranges, string lengths, and custom patterns, plus attribute-based entity validation.",
  "id": "SmartValidationsLibrary",
