  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Now multi-targets net8.0, net9.0, and net10.0 (was net10.0-only). Same 2.0.0 rewrite otherwise: fixed IsValidEmail throwing RegexParseException on every call due to invalid character-class syntax in the email pattern, fixed two conflicting EntityValidator implementations existing side by side (consolidated into one that collects every validation error), fixed the UK phone number regex rejecting real numbers, and added IsValidPostalCode, IsValidUrl, IsValidCreditCardNumber, IsValidPassword, IsValidIPAddress, IsInRange, and IsValidLength, each with a matching validation attribute.",
